{"data":{"visionLeadership":{"data":{"attributes":{"allMetaData":{"metaTitle":"Our Company | ARTEX GM","metaDescription":"Meet ARTEX Global Markets leadership and senior team members.","metaImage":{"data":null,"__typename":"UploadFileEntityResponse"},"keywords":"Art market, investment in art, fine art market, Prince Wenceslas of Liechtenstein, Yassir Benjelloun-Touimi, our company, artex global markets, artex gm","__typename":"ComponentSharedSeo"},"directors_bloc":{"boardPerson":[{"Company":"Chairman of the Board & Co-Founder","Name":"H.S.H. Prince Wenceslas of Liechtenstein","Photo":{"data":{"attributes":{"alternativeText":"prince-wenceslas of liechtenstein.jpg","url":"https://artex-prod-www-artex-io-uploads.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/prince_wenceslas_of_liechtenstein_38ac672def.jpg","__typename":"UploadFile"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntity"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntityResponse"},"__typename":"ComponentLayoutsBoardPeople"},{"Company":"Former SOTHEBY’S","Name":"Dr. Philipp Herzog Von Württemberg","Photo":{"data":{"attributes":{"alternativeText":"dr philipp von wurttemberg.jpg","url":"https://artex-prod-www-artex-io-uploads.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/dr_philipp_von_wurttemberg_b7affbf421.jpg","__typename":"UploadFile"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntity"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntityResponse"},"__typename":"ComponentLayoutsBoardPeople"},{"Company":"Former Chairman of the Board - LME Clear","Name":"Marco Strimer","Photo":{"data":{"attributes":{"alternativeText":null,"url":"https://artex-prod-www-artex-io-uploads.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/Marco_Strimer_b_and_w_01_C_7af70253b1.jpg","__typename":"UploadFile"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntity"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntityResponse"},"__typename":"ComponentLayoutsBoardPeople"}],"title":{"subtitle":"LEADERSHIP","title":"Directors & Advisors","__typename":"ComponentLayoutsBlocTitle"},"__typename":"ComponentLayoutsBoard"},"blocNextPage":null,"founders_bloc":{"founderPerson":[{"Bio":"Prior to becoming CEO and co-owner of a global investment management firm Dalton S.P. , Wenceslas worked for some of the most reputable financial institutions (Goldman Sachs, GE Capital) for over 15 years. His art and banking DNA helps to combine and bridge both worlds.","Name":"H.S.H. Prince Wenceslas of Liechtenstein","Photo":{"data":{"attributes":{"alternativeText":"prince-wenceslas of liechtenstein.jpg","url":"https://artex-prod-www-artex-io-uploads.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/prince_wenceslas_of_liechtenstein_38ac672def.jpg","__typename":"UploadFile"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntity"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntityResponse"},"position":"Chairman & Co-Founder","__typename":"ComponentLayoutsFounderPerson"},{"Bio":"Yassir has over 20 years investment banking experience, occupying prominent roles in powerhouses in London (BNP PARIBAS, BAML, UBS). Yassir successfully set up two similar ventures: ITRAXX at BNP PARIBAS, the first liquid credit index family and the most traded product in credit in 2020; and the UBS Price Improvement Network (PIN) for credit default swaps (CDS) platform which took UBS to top ranks in CDS houses in a short span of time.","Name":"Yassir  Benjelloun-Touimi","Photo":{"data":{"attributes":{"alternativeText":"Yassir BENJELLOUN-TOUIMI (CEO) (BW).png","url":"https://artex-prod-www-artex-io-uploads.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/Yassir_BENJELLOUN_TOUIMI_CEO_BW_9be89f1653.png","__typename":"UploadFile"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntity"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntityResponse"},"position":"Co-Founder & CEO","__typename":"ComponentLayoutsFounderPerson"}],"text":"Prince Wenceslas von Liechtenstein and Yassir Benjelloun-Touimi, experienced investment professionals, co-founded ARTEX to realize their shared vision of making art investing accessible to all. Leveraging their respective professional expertise in finance, the co-founders have created a breakthrough model that opens up a traditionally siloed space.","title":{"subtitle":null,"title":"Founders","__typename":"ComponentLayoutsBlocTitle"},"__typename":"ComponentLayoutsFounderBlock"},"team_bloc":{"list":[{"name":"Yassir  Benjelloun-Touimi","position":"CO-FOUNDER & CEO","visual":{"data":{"attributes":{"alternativeText":"Yassir BENJELLOUN-TOUIMI (CEO) (BW).png","url":"https://artex-prod-www-artex-io-uploads.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/Yassir_BENJELLOUN_TOUIMI_CEO_BW_9be89f1653.png","__typename":"UploadFile"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntity"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntityResponse"},"__typename":"ComponentLayoutsTeamUser"},{"name":"Alexandre Reynaert","position":"CHIEF TECHNOLOGY OFFICER","visual":{"data":{"attributes":{"alternativeText":"Alexandre REYNAERT (CTO Chief Technology Officer) (BW).jpg","url":"https://artex-prod-www-artex-io-uploads.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/Alexandre_REYNAERT_CTO_Chief_Technology_Officer_BW_37defc5d72.jpg","__typename":"UploadFile"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntity"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntityResponse"},"__typename":"ComponentLayoutsTeamUser"},{"name":"Wajid Latiff","position":"CHIEF COMPLIANCE OFFICER","visual":{"data":{"attributes":{"alternativeText":"Wajid LATIFF (Chief Compliance Officer) (BW).jpg","url":"https://artex-prod-www-artex-io-uploads.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/Wajid_LATIFF_Chief_Compliance_Officer_BW_503a698359.jpg","__typename":"UploadFile"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntity"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntityResponse"},"__typename":"ComponentLayoutsTeamUser"},{"name":"Aamir Akram","position":"GROUP CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER","visual":{"data":{"attributes":{"alternativeText":null,"url":"https://artex-prod-www-artex-io-uploads.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/Picture1_aa_b1780ef3bc.jpg","__typename":"UploadFile"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntity"},"__typename":"UploadFileEntityResponse"},"__typename":"ComponentLayoutsTeamUser"}],"title":{"subtitle":null,"title":"Executive Team","__typename":"ComponentLayoutsBlocTitle"},"__typename":"ComponentLayoutsTeamBlock"},"__typename":"VisionLeadership"},"__typename":"VisionLeadershipEntity"},"__typename":"VisionL